:: Off we go. {"position":"1150,450","size":"100,100"}
Benny leads $player.first off of the beach and into the jungle

!!!TK: Some elaboration on setting.

*The planet is Ostia.
*Ostia was once a thriving, engineered "destination planet."
*The holding company had to "right size" their offerings.
*Most of the resident "cast members" as well as the "constructs" (robots, genetically engineered, etc) were left behind as the resort fell apart.

"Wait a minute, let's check out your TeaPot!"

[[Try to use TeaPot.]]


:: PART 1: Falling Action {"position":"225,125","size":"100,100"}
!Part One
!!Falling Action

The ''Redrockers'', those fickle schmucks, have decided your arc is over. They crumpled up the ''Draft'' and threw it in the bin like you weren't anything. But isn't that the point? No, really. Isn't that //your// point? Destined to be a footnote? There to support? There to usher things to a close. You're no ''Lead'', that's for sure, but there's nothing wrong with that. You're damn good at it.

Well now you're out. So what now?

What now? What now? What now? Move on. To your feet. Wake up, damn it.

<a class="blink" data-passage="Waking Up">Wake Up</a>


