:: Redrockers {"position":"125,400","size":"100,100"}
The ''Redrock Corporation'' placed their island HQ in San Francisco Bay, not despite its bad vibes but because of them. Centuries of stories of villainish lairs to back them up. Powerful and amoral and mercinary.

Not to mention that before the ''Fall of the States,'' Red Rock Island was a tiny place where three "counties" came together. A nexus. All places but none. Every story and no story in particular. First Drafts and crumpled ones.

Where were you? [[Oh, right.|PART 1: Falling Action]]


