:: The beach [Benny] {"position":"600,75","size":"100,100"}
<<set $bennyHere to true >>
TK - beach description

A sun blinds you, and you bring up your hand to shield your eyes. The hood slips from your other hand, then dissolves with a skittering sound.

Your vision adjusts as you struggle to your knees. As you surmised, you are on a pristine sandy beach. A peaceful ocean, unnervingly clean and blue, stretches off to the horizon.

There is a ''crab'' here. "Hello," says the crab.

<<linkappend "You look at the crab." t8n>> It is a crab. Friendly looking and pink, but a crab.

It looks at you expectantly.

"What?" you ask. [["\"What did you say?\""|INTRO: Benny]]

<</linkappend>>



