:: Waking Up {"position":"425,50","size":"100,100"}
Oh, goddamn it that was a mistake. Waking up was a mistake. Everything hurts. Every limb is throbbing. And you're dizzy. Wait, are you dizzy? Oh, no. No that's not it. You're lying on the ground. You're lying on your side.

You're lying on... What are the words for these sensations? Damn it. You're lying on something... //hot//. That's the word. And coarse.

Gritty. Damn it. It's sand.

A pulsing roar, muffled and deep. Rumbling through the sand; through your throbbing bones. You're on a beach.

But it's dark. [[Why is it dark?]]


:: Why is it dark? {"position":"500,225","size":"100,100"}
/* TK */

The darkness. The muffling. You've got a sack over your head. You should do something about that.

[[You do something about it.|The beach]]


:: StoryStylesheet [stylesheet]
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Audiowide&family=Cinzel:wght@400..900&family=Google+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,17..18,400..700;1,17..18,400..700&family=Noto+Sans:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&display=swap');
body {
  --background-color: #222831;
  --copy-color: #eeeeee;
  --highlight-color: #0092ca;
  --dim-color: #393e46;
  background: var(--background-color);
  font-family: "Google Sans", sans-serif;
  color: var(--copy-color);
  font-size: 20px;
}

@keyframes blink {
  0% { opacity: 1; }
  50% { opacity: 0; }
  100% { opacity: 1; }
}

.blink {
  animation: blink 1s infinite;
}

pre {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, SF Mono, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
  font-size: 16px;
  padding: 15px;
  background: var(--dim-color);
}

a {
  color: var(--highlight-color);
  border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--highlight-color);
  font-weight: bold;
  &:hover {
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  &.color-copy {
    color: var(--copy-color);
  	border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--copy-color);
  }
}

strong {
  color: #FFF;
}

h1 {
  font-family: "Noto Sans", sans-serif;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-size: 4rem;
  line-height: 100%;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}
h2 {
  font-family: "Google Sans", sans-serif;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-size: 2rem;
  line-height: 140%;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  color: var(--highlight-color);
}
h3 {
  font-family: "Google Sans", sans-serif;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  line-height: 140%;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
	&.dim {
      color: var(--dim-color);
  }
}

img {
  max-width: 100%;
  &.home-banner {
    border: 1px solid var(--copy-color);
  }